\f1\b\fs21 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 \shad\shadx0\shady-20\shadr0\shado0 \shadc0 # AI Stylist (Ari) - README
\f2\b0 \cf5 \strokec5 \shad\shadx0\shady-20\shadr0\shado0 \shadc0 \
\
A conversational fashion advisor that provides personalized style recommendations using Neo4j knowledge graph, CAMEL framework, and OpenAI language models.\
\

\f1\b \cf3 \strokec3 \shad\shadx0\shady-20\shadr0\shado0 \shadc0 ## Overview
\f2\b0 \cf5 \strokec5 \shad\shadx0\shady-20\shadr0\shado0 \shadc0 \
\
The AI Stylist (named Ari) is a conversational agent designed to recommend fashion products based on user preferences. It uses:\
\
- 
\f1\b \shad\shadx0\shady-20\shadr0\shado0 \shadc0 **Neo4j**
\f2\b0 \shad\shadx0\shady-20\shadr0\shado0 \shadc0  knowledge graph for product data storage and retrieval\
- 
\f1\b \shad\shadx0\shady-20\shadr0\shado0 \shadc0 **CAMEL framework**
\f2\b0 \shad\shadx0\shady-20\shadr0\shado0 \shadc0  for agent capabilities and memory\
- 
\f1\b \shad\shadx0\shady-20\shadr0\shado0 \shadc0 **OpenAI language models**
\f2\b0 \shad\shadx0\shady-20\shadr0\shado0 \shadc0  for natural conversation\
\
The system provides personalized fashion recommendations through natural dialogue, remembers user preferences, and makes contextually relevant product suggestions.\
\

\f1\b \cf3 \strokec3 \shad\shadx0\shady-20\shadr0\shado0 \shadc0 ## System Requirements
\f2\b0 \cf5 \strokec5 \shad\shadx0\shady-20\shadr0\shado0 \shadc0 \
\
- Python 3.8 or higher\
- Neo4j database (accessible via Bolt protocol)\
- OpenAI API key\
- Sufficient RAM for concurrent sessions (recommended: 4GB+)\
\

